---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Sarh Al Elm Private School" lang="en">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">About Us</p><h1>A community built on strong foundations</h1><p class="sub">Sarh Al Elm Private School serves Grades 1–8 in Muscat in a bilingual school environment.</p></div></section>
  <section class="block wrap two-col"><div><h2>Our story</h2><p>Sarh Al Elm is a private school serving students in Grades 1–8 in Muscat. Our name — meaning "the edifice of knowledge" — reflects the idea that learning is built step by step, grade by grade.</p><p>We aim to provide a purposeful bilingual school experience in which students can build knowledge, communication skills, confidence and positive learning habits.</p></div><div><h2>Our mission</h2><p>We aim to develop confident, capable learners who think critically, communicate in both Arabic and English, and carry strong values into whatever they pursue next.</p><h2 class="mt">Curriculum information</h2><p>Sarh Al Elm teaches the Oman Ministry of Education Mathematics and Science curriculum and resources developed through the Ministry’s partnership with Cambridge University Press & Assessment.</p><p class="note">This refers to the Ministry of Education–Cambridge curriculum partnership and does not describe Sarh Al Elm as a Cambridge International School or as independently Cambridge-accredited. Further detailed school curriculum information will be published after verification by the school administration.</p><a class="text-link" href="/academics/">Explore academics →</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.page-hero{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:64px 0}.page-hero .eyebrow{color:#BFD8F0;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px}.page-hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:36px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:14px;max-width:640px}.page-hero .sub{color:#DCE7F4;max-width:560px;font-size:15.5px}.block{padding:64px 24px}.two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px}h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;margin-bottom:12px;color:var(--navy-dark)}h2.mt{margin-top:28px}p{color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px}.note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--slate);border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding-left:14px}.text-link{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:800px){.two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>